## One process note
I made a sequencing slip: Steps 5 and 6 should have launched **concurrently in one message** (which also physically guarantees impl-gen can't see `test_suite/`). I ran them sequentially. To preserve that isolation guarantee, I moved `test_helpers/` and `test_suite/` to a holding dir before Step 6 and restored them after — so the implementation was still generated from PRD only, never from the tests. The benchmark's integrity is intact; only the throughput benefit of concurrency was lost.

